{
  "description": "The creature is depicted in left-facing profile standing upright on two hind legs against a plain light background. It has the overall body, fur, and proportions of a red fox from the head to the hind feet and tail, with dense orange-reddish brown fur on the back, head, outer legs and tail, and white to light gray fur on the muzzle, throat, chest and inner legs. A pair of large folded bird wings covers much of the sides of the torso. The animal is posed with its head held high, ears erect, and its long bushy tail extending straight back behind it, with both hind paws on the ground.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "narrow fox muzzle with a black nose, amber-brown eye, white fur on the lower jaw, chin and throat, and orange-brown fur on the muzzle, cheeks and forehead",
      "where": "at the top front of the body, facing left"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two large triangular pointed ears with dark brown to black outer edges and tips and pale cream inner fur",
      "where": "on top of the head, upright and slightly angled"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "two muscular hind legs covered in short to medium orange-brown fur on the outside and white-gray fur on the inside, bent at the hock and stifle in a standing posture",
      "where": "under the torso, supporting the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "two hind paws with dark brown fur, visible toe pads and short dark claws",
      "where": "at the bottom ends of the hind legs, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, thick and very bushy, covered in long orange-brown fur with a darker underside and a white tip at the end",
      "where": "extending rearward from the hindquarters, trailing behind the legs"
    },
    {
      "part": "wings",
      "looks_like": "two large folded wings with layered flight feathers in tan, cream, light gray and brown, with dark spotting, mottling and barring typical of a barn owl",
      "where": "folded along the left and right sides of the upper torso and back, covering the side of the body from shoulder to mid-flank"
    },
    {
      "part": "feathers",
      "looks_like": "dense soft feathers on the wings and upper chest, tan and cream with small black dots and gray mottled patches, with longer barred primaries along the lower edge of the wings",
      "where": "covering the wings and the front of the chest"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "white on the muzzle, throat, chest and inner hind legs contrasting with orange-brown on the back and outer legs, and dark brown-black on the ear tips and paw undersides; wings have speckled and barred owl patterning",
      "where": "across the head, torso, legs, tail and wings"
    }
  ],
